StarGAN v2 subpackage (brainpred.methods.stargan_v2) - license notice
=====================================================================

The code in this folder (model.py, solver.py, checkpoint.py, utils.py) and the
StarGAN v2 input fetchers in brainpred/data/stargan_2d.py are derived from the
official StarGAN v2 implementation:

    StarGAN v2
    Copyright (c) 2020-present NAVER Corp.
    https://github.com/clovaai/stargan-v2

which is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
International License (CC BY-NC 4.0):
    http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Changes made for this project (by Agustin Cartaya): single-channel (grey-level)
images, brain-mask guided high-pass skip connections in the generator instead of
the facial-landmark (FAN) masks, removal of the FAN / video / metric code, and
packaging as part of `brainpred`.

Because this is an adaptation of CC BY-NC 4.0 material, THIS SUBPACKAGE (and the
derived fetchers mentioned above) REMAINS UNDER CC BY-NC 4.0: it may be shared and
adapted for non-commercial purposes only, with attribution to NAVER Corp. and an
indication of the changes. The license of the rest of the `brainpred` package
does not apply to these files.
